+// XStreaming patch: guards every MMKV::initializeMMKV() call in this file.
+// That call (and MMKV::getRootDir(), which nativeEnsureMmkvInitialized's
+// mmkvRootDirReady() guard below reads) touches MMKV's own unsynchronized
+// static root-dir state -- fine with the single call site this file
+// originally had (nativeInstall, below), but nativeEnsureMmkvInitialized
+// adds a second call path reachable from a different thread (Compose's UI
+// thread, if Android recreates both this app's RN-hosting Activity and a
+// native-only Activity concurrently after a process death). Without this
+// lock, a racing nativeInstall and nativeEnsureMmkvInitialized would be a
+// data race on that shared state.
+std::mutex gMmkvInitMutex;
